        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Premium Pay – Except as provided in Article IV, (1), c) below and Article III, (4), time and one-half (1-1/2) the employee's regular straight-time hourly rate of pay shall be paid for:",
            "block_bbox": [
                98,
