        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) Double time shall be paid for Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Eve, Christmas Day, New Years Eye and New Years Day. Double time will only be paid on the actual day of the holiday and not on the date on which the Company celebrates the above holidays as defined in Article V, (5).",
